---
// Enterprise.astro - Enterprise Assurance & Governance
---

<section class="py-24 bg-cyber-dark/60 border-t border-cyber-border/70 relative">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-cyber-indigo/10 border border-cyber-indigo/30 text-cyber-indigo text-xs font-mono mb-4">
        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm">corporate_fare</span>
        <span>ENTERPRISE ASSURANCE</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="font-display font-black text-3xl sm:text-5xl text-white tracking-tight mb-4">
        Hardened for Zero-Trust Enterprise CI/CD
      </h2>
      <p class="font-sans text-slate-300 text-base sm:text-lg">
        Engineered with strict zero-telemetry, offline-first execution, and cryptographically verified SLSA Level 3 build provenance.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
      <!-- Card 1 -->
      <div class="p-8 rounded-2xl bg-cyber-card border border-cyber-border shadow-xl text-left">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-cyber-indigo/20 border border-cyber-indigo/40 flex items-center justify-center text-cyber-cyan mb-6">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-2xl">lock</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-display font-bold text-xl text-white mb-3">100% On-Prem & Air-Gapped</h3>
        <p class="font-sans text-sm text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
          Specter makes zero external network calls. Source code and AST representations never leave your runner boundary or air-gapped environment.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 2 -->
      <div class="p-8 rounded-2xl bg-cyber-card border border-cyber-border shadow-xl text-left">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-cyber-emerald/20 border border-cyber-emerald/40 flex items-center justify-center text-cyber-emerald mb-6">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-2xl">verified_user</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-display font-bold text-xl text-white mb-3">SLSA Level 3 & OpenSSF</h3>
        <p class="font-sans text-sm text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
          Every release binary and Docker image is signed with GitHub OIDC SLSA provenance and passes OpenSSF Scorecard least-privilege standards.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 3 -->
      <div class="p-8 rounded-2xl bg-cyber-card border border-cyber-border shadow-xl text-left">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-cyber-purple/20 border border-cyber-purple/40 flex items-center justify-center text-cyber-purple mb-6">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-2xl">public</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-display font-bold text-xl text-white mb-3">Dual-Hub Governance</h3>
        <p class="font-sans text-sm text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
          Governed under GLASTOR® Core corporate infrastructure with R&D hubs in Malaga TechPark (Spain/EU) and Santiago (Chile/LATAM).
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
